OL,3,GNEWSAChainsaw artist swaps wood for
OL,4,Asand on TV contest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wood sculptor has said he "jumped at
OL,7,Fthe chance" to swap his chainsaw for a
OL,8,Fbucket and spade to take part in a TV
OL,9,Fsand-sculpting competition.
OL,11,FShane Green, from Otley, is a
OL,12,Fcontestant on BBC Two show Race Against
OL,13,Fthe Tide, which sees teams compete to
OL,14,Fcreate sand artwork, before the sea
OL,15,Fdestroys it.
OL,17,FKnown as the Yorkshire Carver, Green's
OL,18,Fsculptures can be seen across many
OL,19,Fpublic spaces, including RHS Harlow
OL,20,FCarr in Harrogate and Roundhay Park in
OL,21,FLeeds.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
