OL,3,GNEWSAChainsaw artist swaps wood for
OL,4,Asand on TV contest
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen said of switching to sand: "It's
OL,7,Fnatural and it disappears. I thought
OL,8,Fthere was a lot of beautiful things
OL,9,Fabout it, and that's what attracted
OL,10,Fme."
